WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:50.890
Someone once said...

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:53.590
Just like kintaro-ame,　

00:01:50.890 --> 00:02:01.530
<i>Kintaro-ame</i>: cylindrical candy made so 
that a face appears wherever it is sliced

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:58.130
there is first-rate finely 
chopped fried bonito

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.530
with a face appearing on each shaving...

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:05.800
Face-fried Bonito!

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:11.780
There are hotcakes that are 
light, fluffy and boast

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:17.820
the finest sweetness, glowing 
qualities that make it seem

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.880
as if Buddha himself has appeared.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:26.360
And when you take a bite, it's so delicious

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.030
that you'll feel like you've 
become the Buddha...

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:37.440
Buddhotcakes!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:46.880
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:52.280
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.360
Toriko and the rest of the Four 
Kings had a brilliant victory

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.190
against the Four-Beasts who came from 
the Gourmet World to eat humans.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:37.960
But Rin passed on a shocking truth that 
she learned from Ichiryu's message.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:41.030
The Four-Beasts isn't actually 
four Beasts, but one!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:45.600
Also, the Four-Beasts changed its 
strategy from its last attack.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:58.350
It's possible that the main body 
itself will head for the Human World.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:01.550
Toriko and the others desperately 
chased after the four Beasts,

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.790
but a monster had already 
appeared at Food Park...

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:08.030
The true form of the Four-Beasts!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:43.090
The Four-Beasts' Shocking 
Combined Form and Green Rain!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.670
What is that?!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.530
How can it travel so fast?!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:25.530
Run! Run for your lives!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.330
What's the ruckus about?!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.400
I came over 'cause I heard 
the world's in a pinch,

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.970
but everybody's panicking.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.180
Come on, we've gotta get out of here!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:39.340
Well, well, missy.

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.450
We meet again!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.980
But you're not gonna even say my name today?

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.280
We don't have time for this!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.950
You can relax now.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.960
The savior of this planet,

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:54.490
Gourmet Hunter Zonge is here, 
so everything will be alright.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:56.460
Zonge-sama, look at that!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.870
For cripes' sake, don't whimper.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:04.100
I'll pulverize the damn thing.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.640
That's one honkin' cartoon character costume!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.550
That's no costume!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.660
I guess it's up to me...

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.810
A Protect Tree...

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:24.880
It's not really for protecting 
man-made objects,

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:28.750
but I set it up all through the city.

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.960
I'm not gonna let this end up 
like a giant monster movie...

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.300
...monster!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:45.000
What the hell is that?!

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:49.640
Oh, no! That area hasn't been reinforced yet!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.410
Z-Zebra!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:57.580
Don't worry, little people!

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:02.350
I'm protectin' the buildings 
with a Sound Wall!

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.520
So is that

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.630
the true form of the Four-Beasts?

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:39.420
What the hell? It absorbed the four Beasts.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.790
Hey, you're late!

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:46.760
That horse of yours is too fast!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.680
The Four Kings are here!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.590
The Four Kings!

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:10.290
It'll be alright now!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.530
I see...

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:20.730
So that's the main body.

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.000
Let's go!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.200
Wait!

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.290
W-What the hell is that?!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.460
It's grody to the max!

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.550
W-What is it?!

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:12.450
Hey, what the hell is this?!

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.280
Hey!

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:15.450
What's it tryin' to do?

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:17.160
It's disgusting!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.760
We're in trouble.

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.090
This is Green Rain!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.030
Green Rain?

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:27.170
Otherwise known as "Disease Rain".

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.440
It's poisonous to the human 
body and if you get wet,

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.010
you'll have less than an hour to live.

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.310
Seriously?!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.780
We're all soaked!

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.180
Komatsu-kun!

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.780
You need to get to Gourmet Tower right away!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.520
Go back to Meal King!

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.190
Chef Yuda's restaurant?

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.520
Why?

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:59.500
He'll know how to make food 
that breaks down the poison!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.930
But he probably needs help!

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.940
What's going on here?

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:08.570
The Gourmet World's Green Rain...

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:12.540
This isn't even one-millimeter 
less than a worst-case scenario.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.310
Zebra! Let him use the horse!

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:16.750
Do what ya want!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.620
I'm countin' on you, Komatsu!

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:19.650
R-Right!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.460
Alright. And now, with all due speed,

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.460
we've got to take that thing down.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.970
Outta my way.

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:37.770
I'll finish this deal in an instant.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.040
Zebra!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:44.140
If you unleash that vulgar voice of 
yours, innocents will be affected too!

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:45.580
Anyway, let's do this!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.710
How many years has it been

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:50.450
since the four of us last fought together?

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.450
I can't stop quiverin' with excitement.

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:55.920
Just goes to show...

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.220
...how tough this bastard is!

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:18.240
G-Get inside a building!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.680
Check that out!

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.350
Man, the color's washin' right off of it!

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:24.920
It is <i>not</i> a costume!

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.880
I don't think this is safe!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.520
What's not safe?!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.030
Yeesh.

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:41.730
Why does it have to be 
such a pain in the ass?

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:57.550
I never imagined the entire Human 
World being rained on by poison.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.750
This guy must be desperate 
too, don't you think?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.190
What do you think of his smell, Toriko?

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:06.560
No real change.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:11.430
I'm not pickin' up any hormones that 
are secreted out of nervousness either.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:14.400
Sound of its respiration... Blood pressure...

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.800
Heartbeat... No changes with any of 'em.

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.140
Its electromagnetic waves 
aren't disturbed either.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.910
But most importantly,

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.580
I can't see the shadow of death upon it.

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:25.910
I see...

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:30.450
So being this relaxed even 
when faced with the four of us

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:35.150
means it only sees us as food...

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:43.360
And the Green Rain is just like dressing 
splashed on ingredients for this guy.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.730
It's an evil, revolting son of a bitch.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.930
In other words, as Zebra would say...

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:53.170
He's a cocky bastard.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:57.780
Then let's waste no time 
in beating and eating him.

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.910
It's been a long time since the 
four of us have hunted together.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.310
I got tingles goin' up and down my spine.

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.690
Hey! Zebra!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.920
I don't need the rest of youse!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:14.260
I'm more than a match for this thing!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.530
Jet Voice!

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.540
That idiot, going off on his own!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.710
Yeesh. Not beautiful at all.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.610
Actually,

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.910
it seems Zebra has already 
been acting on his own.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:39.750
He sent out Sound Bullets to 
hundreds of millions of people.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:46.520
Hey, you little rats, if you don't 
wanna die, get the hell away from here!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.790
It's Zebra!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.360
Better not let yourself 
get rained on any more!

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:57.370
Although if you got a death 
wish, that's different.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:00.970
And look at that.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.580
It looks like energy is already building up.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:15.120
Meteor Noise!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:22.430
Beat Punch!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.200
Alright, let's go! Follow Zebra's lead!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.870
Chef Yuda!

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.340
Chef Komatsu...

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:33.640
A-Antidote!

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.870
T-The rain will kill everyone!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.810
We've got less than an hour to make a dish!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.110
Calm down!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.380
A dish to counter the poisonous Green Rain...

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:48.820
Certainly, I can make it without 
even one millimeter being off.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.090
Thank goodness! Then let's get started!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.760
However,

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:54.990
it's impossible.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:09.640
Zebra!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.150
It escaped the vibrations

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:28.890
by letting them out of its body.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.030
Kiss!

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:35.830
Blind Feather!

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.700
That'll cut off your field of vision!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.870
Now!

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.310
Poison Arrow!

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:57.590
Coco!

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:05.560
Impossible?! What do you mean?!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:10.070
I mean, making enough for hundreds 
of millions of people in one hour,

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.040
that's not even one millimeter's 
worth of the time that's necessary.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.710
Even if I went all out,

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:22.510
I'd only be able to make enough 
for 100,000 people at most.

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:26.990
I'll do everything I can to help you!

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:29.950
But with just one extra person, that isn't 
even a millimeter's worth of enough.

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.190
B-But...

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:43.600
Well done, Queen!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.440
Now take my Super Hair Shot!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.180
W-What?!

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.020
The shock from the punch

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.860
traveled through its body and hit Queen!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.160
W-What is this smoke?!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:14.030
Adhesive particles...

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:17.170
They're getting tangled in my 
hair, keeping me from moving!

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.640
Sunny!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:29.150
Bastard! It has a clear 
understanding of our abilities!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.660
Spiked Punch!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:40.260
Spiked Punch!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:44.030
Leg Knife! Leg Fork! Spiked...

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.170
Monster...

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.680
F-For real?!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.550
I don't believe it! What is this?!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:08.850
Toriko!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:12.020
Coco! Bro! Zebra!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.630
Its Capture Level is insane!

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:15.960
And this rain...

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.330
Everyone's lives...

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.170
Hurry, Komatsu!

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:25.000
Can't we do something?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.870
We'd need a lot more people.

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:32.410
And I'm talking master chefs.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:37.580
Ask and you shall receive.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.120
We came to help.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:55.030
S-Setsuno-san!

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:58.940
Well, shall we cook, Yuda-chan?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:06.410
I have been alone

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:13.820
Ever since that day

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:21.590
All I got was a definite history

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:28.300
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:31.970
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.370
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:39.040
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:42.610
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:46.450
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.120
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:58.230
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:04.040
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:08.570
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:15.480
Hiding Level 9

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:11.510
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 9!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:13.410
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.480
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.750
Well, today we're at Yosaku's Revival Lab.

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:22.450
Where could Yun be?

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:25.490
Yun is... right here!

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:33.430
How was it?

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:36.600
There are so many things 
in Yosaku's Revival Lab

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:39.170
that it looked like it was 
easy for Yun to hide, huh?

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:41.470
My room is messy too

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.740
so it might be easy for Yun 
to hide there as well...

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:47.210
I'd better get it organized.

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:50.980
And now on to our next segment!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:54.150
Who could have expected the Four Kings to take such a beating?

00:22:54.150 --> 00:22:57.540
It can't end like this! Get up, Toriko!

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.330
The Four Kings' Toughest Predicament! Komatsu's Resolve!

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:03.290
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
